<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.30 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.30 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance</p>
<p>for the rest of the month was 6.30 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for June 4			7,700</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for June	     6,350</p>
<p> Average reserves to May 31			   6,960</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,299</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
